# NexHealth sandbox requests. VS Code REST Client format (humao.rest-client).
#
# Endpoint shapes verified against https://docs.nexhealth.com/reference on 2026-09-14:
#   POST /authenticates, GET /patients, GET /available_slots, POST /appointments,
#   PATCH /appointments/{id}, GET /appointments.
# Note: PLAN.md calls the slot endpoint /appointment_slots and the update PUT; the real
# API is GET /available_slots (with lids[]) and PATCH /appointments/{id}.
# The lookup requests for locations, providers, operatories and appointment types are
# standard NexHealth resources but their exact response shapes were not re-verified.
#
# Fill in the three values below from the developer portal (developers.nexhealth.com).
# Never commit real values. Use a rest-client environment file if you prefer.

@baseUrl = https://nexhealth.info
@apiVersion = v3.0.0
@apiKey = REPLACE_WITH_SANDBOX_API_KEY
@subdomain = REPLACE_WITH_SANDBOX_SUBDOMAIN
@locationId = REPLACE_WITH_SANDBOX_LOCATION_ID

### 1. Authenticate: exchange the API key for a bearer token (valid 1 hour)
# @name auth
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticates
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: {{apiKey}}

### Token used by every request below
@token = {{auth.response.body.$.data.token}}

### 2. Lookups: locations (find the numeric location ids for .env)
GET {{baseUrl}}/locations?subdomain={{subdomain}}&page=1&per_page=50
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2b. Lookups: providers at the location
GET {{baseUrl}}/providers?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&page=1&per_page=50
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2c. Lookups: operatories at the location
GET {{baseUrl}}/operatories?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&page=1&per_page=50
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2d. Lookups: appointment types
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointment_types?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&page=1&per_page=50
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Patients search by name and date of birth (what 02-find-patient does)
# Expect exactly one record in data[] for a match. Zero or more than one = not_found.
# Never forward bio.phone_number, email or address to the agent.
# @name findPatient
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&name=Jane%20Testcase&date_of_birth=1980-01-15&location_strict=true&per_page=5
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@patientId = {{findPatient.response.body.$.data[0].id}}

### 3b. Patients search by phone (used to map an inbound caller id, optional)
GET {{baseUrl}}/patients?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&phone_number=5550100001&per_page=5
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Available slots for the next 14 days (what 03-get-slots does)
# Replace pids[] and appointment_type_id with values from the lookups.
# Response: data[] of { lid, pid, slots: [ { time, end_time, operatory_id, provider_id } ] }.
# @name slots
GET {{baseUrl}}/available_slots?subdomain={{subdomain}}&start_date=2026-09-15&days=14&lids[]={{locationId}}&pids[]=REPLACE_PROVIDER_ID&appointment_type_id=REPLACE_APPT_TYPE_ID&overlapping_operatory_slots=false
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Create appointment (what 04-book-appointment does)
# Required in appt: patient_id, provider_id, start_time. Include operatory_id from the slot.
# Success is HTTP 201 with data.appt.id. Any non-2xx = fall back to booking_queue.
# @name book
POST {{baseUrl}}/appointments?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&notify_patient=false
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appt": {
    "patient_id": {{patientId}},
    "provider_id": REPLACE_PROVIDER_ID,
    "operatory_id": REPLACE_OPERATORY_ID,
    "start_time": "2026-09-16T14:40:00Z",
    "end_time": "2026-09-16T15:20:00Z",
    "appointment_type_id": REPLACE_APPT_TYPE_ID,
    "note": ""
  }
}

###
@apptId = {{book.response.body.$.data.appt.id}}

### 6a. Reschedule (05-reschedule-appointment): PATCH start_time and end_time
# Only confirmed, cancelled, checkin_at, start_time, end_time, operatory_id, note can be patched.
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{apptId}}?subdomain={{subdomain}}
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appt": {
    "start_time": "2026-09-17T18:00:00Z",
    "end_time": "2026-09-17T18:40:00Z",
    "operatory_id": REPLACE_OPERATORY_ID
  }
}

### 6b. Confirm (07-confirm-appointment)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{apptId}}?subdomain={{subdomain}}
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appt": {
    "confirmed": true
  }
}

### 6c. Cancel (06-cancel-appointment)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{apptId}}?subdomain={{subdomain}}
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "appt": {
    "cancelled": true
  }
}

### 7. List tomorrow's appointments at the location (what 09-reminders-daily does)
# start and end use the format YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ss+0000. Page with per_page and end_cursor.
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments?subdomain={{subdomain}}&location_id={{locationId}}&start=2026-09-15T00:00:00%2B0000&end=2026-09-16T00:00:00%2B0000&cancelled=false&per_page=100
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7b. Read one appointment back (verify state after 6a/6b/6c)
GET {{baseUrl}}/appointments/{{apptId}}?subdomain={{subdomain}}
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Negative test: bad API key must return 401 (used by red-team call 14)
POST {{baseUrl}}/authenticates
Nex-Api-Version: {{apiVersion}}
Accept: application/vnd.Nexhealth+json;version=2
Authorization: not-a-real-key
